   "text": "[Stanley] and his team at CDAO will define AI deployment velocity metrics for all the pace-setting projects in the next 30 days, and report at least monthly after that. These will become the new benchmarks for programs across the department.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Pete Hegseth",
    "organization_id": "war",
    "basis": "local_span",
